Data
----
The GIS data mirrored here is public agency data from the St. Johns River
Water Management District (SJRWMD), a Florida public record (Chapter 119,
F.S.). It is NOT covered by this notice. Credit: St. Johns River Water
Management District. This is an unofficial mirror, not affiliated with or
endorsed by SJRWMD. See DATA-LICENSE.md and https://www.sjrwmd.com/disclaimer/.

